TITLE Fe K-edge XANES calculation

* Calculation control
CONTROL 1 1 1 1 1 1
PRINT 1 0 0 0 0 3

* Absorption edge
EDGE K
TARGET 1

* Cluster radius
RMAX 5.0

* SCF parameters
SCF 7.0

* Exchange potential
EXCHANGE 0 0.0 0.0

* Atomic coordinates
ATOMS
  0  Fe   0.0000   0.0000   0.0000
  1  O    2.1500   0.0000   0.0000
  2  O   -2.1500   0.0000   0.0000
  3  O    0.0000   2.1500   0.0000
  4  O    0.0000  -2.1500   0.0000
  5  O    0.0000   0.0000   2.1500
  6  O    0.0000   0.0000  -2.1500
END
